] [1237 2 "// tp_new of a pyi type: a C type's instance over a built-in base allocated (bornNew), else the built-in's __new__"] [1272 2 "// slot_tp_new (Objects/typeobject.c): a class's tp_new whose __new__ is its own (classNew), the subtype's __new__"] [1273 2 "// called with the subtype first"] [1299 2 "// tp_dealloc of a pyi type: a C instance's built-in part given back and its memory freed (a pyi object's own"] [1300 2 "// memory is Go's: nothing)"] [1318 2 "// _PyTuple_Resize (Objects/tupleobject.c): *p a tuple only C holds, made newsize long (a new tuple: pyi's are"] [1319 2 "// Go's), the items past the end given back, the new ones NULL"] [1353 2 "// PyState_AddModule: capi_tail.go (modules by index)"] [1354 2 "// PyErr_NewException (Python/errors.c): a class NAME's last part, of base (Exception by default; a tuple of bases"] [1355 2 "// too) and dict, its __module__ NAME's first part"] [1386 2 "// PyObject_CallFunction, PyObject_CallMethod (Objects/call.c): the arguments Py_BuildValue's format makes, a tuple"] [1387 2 "// its items"] [1474 2 "// _PyObject_GC_New (Python/gc.c; the limited API's PyObject_GC_New before 3.8, xxlimited_35's, py-eval-1122): _PyObject_New's"] [1475 2 "// (pyi's collector tracks the object; PyObject_GC_Track and PyObject_GC_Del as before)"] [1498 2 "// PyWeakref_GetRef, PyWeakref_IsDead (Objects/weakrefobject.c) over pyi's references and proxies (PyWeakref_Check:"] [1499 2 "// a ref, a proxy or a callable proxy); the referent, or nil when it is dead"] [1573 21 "// big-endian"] [1591 2 "// PyCFunction_Call (Objects/methodobject.c, the stable ABI's): PyObject_Call"] [1593 2 "// _PyArg_ParseStack (Python/getargs.c): PyArg_ParseTuple's format over a vectorcall's stack (clinic's parsers)"] [1605 2 "// _PyBytes_Resize (Objects/bytesobject.c): *p a bytes only C holds, made newsize long (a new bytes: pyi's value"] [1606 2 "// is Go's; its contents copied from the mirror, which C may have written), NULL and the error on failure"] [1633 1 "//